00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:07.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On ne peut rien changer sans

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:10.210 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un peu indisposer des gens.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:11.511 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il s'agit de le faire de la

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:12.846 size:53% position:73% line:53%
meilleure manière possible.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:14.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'était en 2016, André Arthur

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:15.515 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tentait un ultime  la

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:16.850 size:53% position:73% line:53%
radio de Québec, en promettant

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:18.185 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du bout des lèvres d'éviter les

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.486 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dérapages. Moins de deux ans

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
